enera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Rost advanced two places ahead of Bac and Jourdan.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap Segrave took the lead ahead of Bourlier, Lehoux, Morel and Chiron, having made the fastest lap in 3m13s at 135.340 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Rost advanced two places ahead of Bac and Jourdan.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":3,"text":"On the third lap Chiron passed Morel for fourth place with Morel now fifth followed closely by Moriceau.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":3,"text":"On the third lap Chiron passed Morel for fourth place with Morel now fifth followed closely by Moriceau.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":5,"text":"Williams pits and rejoins at once, down to tenth.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":5,"text":"Williams pits and rejoins at once, down to tenth.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":6,"text":"The race continued and it was interesting to see Williams making up places every lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":6,"text":"The race continued and it was interesting to see Williams making up places every lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":7,"text":"Moriceau passes Chiron for fourth.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":7,"text":"Moriceau passes Chiron for fourth.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":10,"text":"Segrave leads; Bourlier is threatened by Lehoux 40 metres behind. The first three are within three seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"Segrave leads; Bourlier is threatened by Lehoux 40 metres behind. The first three are within three seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"Lehoux drops from third to sixth; the three Talbots lead from Chiron and Williams.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":11,"text":"Lehoux drops from third to sixth; the three Talbots lead from Chiron and Williams.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":12,"text":"Morel pits for new tyres.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":12,"text":"Morel pits for new tyres.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":13,"text":"Foresti stops. Williams recovered superbly. He made up time in every turn.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":13,"text":"Foresti stops. Williams recovered superbly. He made up time in every turn.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":20,"text":"Montier retires. Chiron cuts Moriceau's advantage from 13 to 3 seconds.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":20,"text":"Montier retires. Chiron cuts Moriceau's advantage from 13 to 3 seconds.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":25,"text":"On lap 25 Lehoux stopped at the pits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":25,"text":"On lap 25 Lehoux stopped at the pits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":26,"text":"Williams passes Chiron and moves ahead of Moriceau, who drops to fifth; three Talbots and three Bugattis fill the top six.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":26,"text":"Williams passes Chiron and moves ahead of Moriceau, who drops to fifth; three Talbots and three Bugattis fill the top six.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":30,"text":"Bac, Trouv\u00e9 and Martin have retired; eleven cars remain.","q":false},{"lap":30,"text":"Bac, Trouv\u00e9 and Martin have retired; eleven cars remain.","q":false},{"lap":32,"text":"Bourlier stops briefly for service; Williams moves up to second.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":32,"text":"Bourlier stops briefly for service; Williams moves up to second.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":40,"text":"Rost had moved from ninth to seventh place. Lehoux who had been sixth ten laps before found himself near the end of the field.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":40,"text":"Rost had moved from ninth to seventh place. Lehoux who had been sixth ten laps before found himself near the end of the field.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":42,"text":"Williams left Bourlier behind and attacked Segrave. It became exciting.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":42,"text":"Williams left Bourlier behind and attacked Segrave. It became exciting.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":43,"text":"On the forty-third lap, it was learned with surprise 